Z||000000||BroCar 87||05-13-2000||07:32 PM||||Is it really that hard to swap the chrysler FWD 4 cyl. engine into the fiero? I read theorgre's reply about the 4 CYLINDER SWAPS post, and it got me to thinking. If you can swap in the 2.5 from the Chrysler family... you put on a TURBO from the 2.2.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Would it be toooooooo much trouble to do the Chrysler swap or has NO ONE even thought about it??? ||||reg||1
